text.paragraph:
Dosing with cinacalcet in pediatric study 1 was stopped because of a fatality in a cinacalcet-treated individual. The individual was noted to be severely hypocalcemic at the time of death. The cause of death was multifactorial and a contribution of cinacalcet to the death could not be excluded 

                                 [see Warnings and Precautions (5.1)
                              ].
